1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,087
Writing, task two. E-mail number 6: Noise in the building.

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:16,434
Your neighbour makes noise at night. Write an e-mail to the building manager. Write at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:25,133 --> 00:00:26,200
Good afternoon,

4
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,622
I live at Lobečská 12, on the third floor.

5
00:00:29,933 --> 00:00:32,115
I have a problem with my neighbour on the fourth floor.

6
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,679
Every evening he plays music very loudly.

7
00:00:34,967 --> 00:00:37,148
It's always from ten in the evening until two at night.

8
00:00:37,433 --> 00:00:40,505
I get up at four in the morning for work and I can't sleep.

9
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:43,277
Could you please talk to the neighbour?

10
00:00:43,567 --> 00:00:44,535
Thank you.

11
00:00:44,833 --> 00:00:51,592
This e-mail has 53 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

12
00:00:52,300 --> 00:01:01,311
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
